          "MEC weights correct the interview-weight choice in the historical project.",
          "Complete-case exclusions may introduce selection bias.",
          "PHQ-9 >=10 is a screening threshold, not a clinical diagnosis.",
          "SLD012 describes the main sleep period on weekdays/workdays, not total 24-hour sleep. Its boundary codes remain within the appropriate broad sleep category.",
          "PHQ-9 includes a sleep symptom item; conceptual overlap limits interpretation of the sleep association."
        ],
